  "description": "Tri Trap is a small climbing frame built on a triangle, with a different way up on each face. A green climbing wall, a ring ladder and a rope net lead to the top, and a pink slide brings children back down. Working out which face to try first builds problem solving, confidence and strength. Tri Trap takes 15 to 20 children. At 15'3\" x 9'4\", with a safe play area of 21'3\" x 14'4\", it needs little ground and fits a society corner or a preschool yard. It is an Escapade piece in mixed colours, and it also works as a climbing add-on beside a larger tower. The galvanised frame, moulded parts, laminates and rope have 3 years of warranty cover. Ask us to place it on a drawing next to your other equipment.",
